{"name":"-54-B-12","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"m_avg_labyrinth","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Darkness. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her sight, hearing, and all her senses are gone. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie is held captive by an endless stretch of darkness. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The silence is both eerie and familiar. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She chuckles sardonically to herself."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...How rude, interrupting my conversation with my friends like that."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie cannot hear her own voice at all, but she still challenges the darkness."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tareus","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You betrayed us."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Heartbeat","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The voice is not speaking through Maggie's ears and hearing module. It feels more like a direct punch to her neural cloud."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now, now, I did nothing so heinous. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If memory serves, our business has already concluded. I helped you find that Soviet agent, did I not?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tareus","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Save your flowery words. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I want her coordinates."}]}]},{"spri