ette appears out of thin air."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Creep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The planchette hovers slowly over the Ouija board... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Yes/No. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It whiplashes back and forth between the two answers. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"Miss Eve.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Breathing","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tareus inhales sharply."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Tareus","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tareus","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Maggie, you did it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Shield_Startup","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pzzzzzt..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Robots_Floor","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bam!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Tareus","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_22W_SFX_chant","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Tareus","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You get to see the real me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Grey_Hand_Mech","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This time, her hover cannons don't just appear individually. Instead, a whole wall of them are arrayed behind Tareus."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_The_Division_Flare_Gun","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_The_Division_Flare_Gun","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"